          Located in the 83401 postal district of greater Idaho Falls, Lincoln showcases distinct architectural styles and mechanical demands. Mix of established 1950s-1970s residences, newer single-family subdivisions, modular homes, and light industrial / commercial shops. Operating a residential or commercial water heating system in this environment requires an intimate understanding of local housing layouts, elevation shifts, and eastern Idaho seasonal swings.
        </p>
        <p>
